WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:03,650
Mr. Shen

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,780
Mr. Shen, give me money

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,080
I'm a joker

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:11,180
Of course Mr. Shen also has to pay and get out.

5
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,520
The puppy is here

6
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,920
You haven't seen it with your own eyes

7
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,720
Just him in a clown suit

8
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,620
Let him bite his tail, he will bite his tail

9
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,920
That look made me stunned

10
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:32,210
Jian Tong, come with me

11
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,910
Mr. Zhu wants to hear someone sing

12
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:39,460
Mr. Zhu, don’t you want to listen to music?

13
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:42,360
I'll ask the best singer from our public relations department to sing for you

14
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,360
Sing until you are satisfied

15
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:47,240
Chicken, no

16
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:49,240
Hahahaha, sing, keep singing

17
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:53,480
My voice has become hoarse, but my voice has become better.

18
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,980
you have to thank me

19
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:56,280
I made you sing

20
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,980
Only then will your voice become better-sounding
